Build tasks
  ok      the four default build tasks are offered
  ok      build module (debug) builds a module of the active file with debug information
  ok      build module builds a module without debug information
  ok      build executable (debug) builds an executable
  ok      compilation errors are reported as problems on the source file
  ok      a build task without an active editor does not build anything
  ok      copybook directories from superbol.toml are passed to cobc
  ok      the dialect from superbol.toml is passed to cobc
  ok      the superbol.cobcPath setting selects the compiler
  ok      a tasks.json task of type superbol builds a module by default
  ok      a tasks.json task can build an executable
  ok      extraArgs of a tasks.json task are passed to cobc
  ok      a tasks.json task with a missing compiler fails
  no bug  listingsTarget of a tasks.json task generates listings in that directory
  BUG?    customizing a default build task in tasks.json applies to that task
            -> tasks named SuperBOL: build module (debug): SuperBOL/build module (debug), Workspace/SuperBOL: build module (debug)
  no bug  building a file whose name contains a space
